<title>USA: Unitech Industries names Toback auditors.</title>
<headline>Unitech Industries names Toback auditors.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unitech Industries Inc said on Friday it named Phoenix-based Toback CPAs PC the company's auditor.</p>
<p>Toback has been in operation for 50 years, the company said. Unitech designs, develops, makes and distributes wireless communications accessories.</p>
<p>On March 5, the company said it emerged from bankruptcy proceedings.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
